    "text": "If the domain of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mo>|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>|</mo></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mo>{</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>}</mo></math>, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi></math> is equal to :",
