  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>log</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>≤</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>≤</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>6</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>Also, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≠</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Using <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>i</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo> </mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo> </mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>i</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mn>2</mn></mfenced></math></p><p>So, on comparing with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mi>γ</mi></mfenced></math> we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mi>α</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>β</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>γ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>11</mn></math></p>",
